"Composite precipitation radar, two hours of it. The free tier serves tiles only down to a low zoom, so it softens as you close in rather than sharpening — but it stays on the map all the way in, the same way the web tracker's does." = "2時間分の合成降水レーダー。無料版は低いズームまでしかタイルがないため、拡大すると鮮明にならずぼやけますが、ウェブ版と同じく最後まで地図に残ります。";
"How far the air at the chosen level is from the standard atmosphere. Warm is thin: the same aircraft climbs worse and burns more in it." = "選んだ高度の空気が標準大気からどれだけずれているか。暖かいほど空気は薄く、同じ機体でも上昇性能が落ち燃料を多く使います。";
"How much the wind changes between this level and the one below, per thousand feet. Not a turbulence forecast — it is the field turbulence forecasts are built from, and the bumps are where it is strong." = "この高度と下の高度の間で、1,000フィートあたり風がどれだけ変わるか。乱気流予報そのものではありませんが、その元になる値で、強い所ほど揺れます。";
"NASA's global satellite imagery, a day at a time. Reads at cruise and out over the ocean, where there is no radar to see with — but it is yesterday's picture rather than this minute's, and the strip can be dragged back through the last few days. Softens as you close in: it is a photograph of the ground, and a magnified photograph is a blurred photograph." = "NASA の全球衛星画像を1日単位で表示。レーダーのない巡航中や海上で役立ちますが、今この瞬間ではなく昨日の画像で、バーで数日前までさかのぼれます。拡大するとぼやけます。地上の写真を拡大すればぼやけるのは当然です。";
"No field. The barbs, if they are on, are drawn over bare map." = "フィールドなし。矢羽根がオンなら地図の上に直接描かれます。";
"No weather tiles. The map draws the traffic and nothing under it." = "天気タイルなし。地図には交通だけを描きます。";
"Radar" = "レーダー";
